             10         DEF  DEFY
             11  * ABSTRACT:
             12  *
             13  *       PLACE THE USER FUNCTION PROGRAM-
             14  *       BYTE-COUNTER AND NUMBER OF ARGUMENTS
             15  *       IN USER-FUNCTION-TABLE (UFT) THUS
